Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.26,Chinese,C05-03-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}先看方案A，整支军队沿选定路线直走，目标是伦敦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.26,English,C05-03-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}First, Plan A keeps the whole army together on the chosen route to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:11.83,Chinese,C05-03-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}从共同起点算起，第五十一个游戏日，我们第一次观察到它已经抵达。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:11.83,English,C05-03-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}We first observed it there 51 game days after the shared start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:16.33,Chinese,C05-03-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}前一个观察点是第四十九日，军队还在路上。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:16.33,English,C05-03-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}At the previous observation, on day 49, the army was still travelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.10,Chinese,C05-03-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}所以，到达发生在这两次观察之间；
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.10,English,C05-03-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}It therefore arrived between those observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:25.70,Chinese,C05-03-S05,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}第五十一日是首次看到结果的日期，精确到达时刻仍未知。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:25.70,English,C05-03-S05,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Day 51 is when we first saw the result; the exact arrival time is still unknown.
